&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Agile Robots, we build intelligent robotic systems that learn from high-quality real-world data. To keep our data collection site running at full capacity, we are looking for a Robot Service Engineer (m/f/d) who keeps our robots, teleoperation devices and recording systems operational every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be the first technical contact on site. You will diagnose and fix hardware and software issues, maintain the robot fleet, and work closely with our R&amp;amp;D teams to resolve deeper technical problems quickly. Your work directly determines how much usable data the site can produce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is ideal for someone with a hands-on technical mindset who enjoys troubleshooting, works systematically, and wants to grow with cutting-edge robotics and AI technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site Technical Support
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide daily first-line technical support for robots, teleoperation devices, cameras and data recording systems on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve hardware, software, network and calibration issues to minimize downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teleoperators and project coordinators with technical questions during data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; System Setup
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, set up and calibrate robots and teleoperation workstations for new tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance, replace parts and keep the robot fleet in working condition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain records of faults, repairs and spare parts usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;R&amp;amp;D Collaboration &amp;amp; Issue Resolution
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate complex issues to R&amp;amp;D with clear reproduction steps, logs and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and deploy software updates, fixes and new features on site, and give feedback on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring problems and propose improvements to hardware, software and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Documentation
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robots and equipment are operated in line with safety and operational guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and update troubleshooting guides, SOPs and setup instructions for the site team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or vocational training in mechatronics, electrical engineering, robotics, computer science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience troubleshooting electromechanical systems, robots or industrial equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Linux, command line tools and reading system logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, independent way of working with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills in English; able to explain technical issues clearly to engineers and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robotic arms, ROS/ROS 2, or teleoperation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills in Python or Bash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cameras, sensors, networking or data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in field service, technical support or a production / lab environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nation

