&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and implement software solutions of test benches for complex mechatronic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate design, construction, and commissioning of test benches for mechatronic components and industrial-grade manipulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate test results and provide feedback as part of a multidisciplinary development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data acquisition and data analysis on component and system level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and document test and calibration procedures following state-of-the-art regulatory frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, propose, and verify component and system requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
