&lt;li&gt;Sound knowledge in the analysis of mechatronic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C++ / Python for data analysis and test bench automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in mechanical/electrical / automation system design, construction, or commissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to collaborate &amp;amp; take on diverse responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System-oriented thinking and structured working approach&lt;/li&gt;
