&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based development and debugging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV flight testing, system validation, and troubleshooting in real-world operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of drone manufacturing, QC processes, and End-of-Line testing methodologies is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills when workin

